// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Korean game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf), using the names of the
// Korean release (사령부, 군수 공장, 스커드 스톰, 입자 캐논, 블랙 로투스, 오버로드, ...). EVA and
// officers use the formal 합쇼체 and "장군님"; enemy generals speak down to the player. Hotkeys
// follow the "이름(&K)" convention. Multiplayer map names stay in English.
// Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

